{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37631","headline":"叙事感恩上狄右丞 · 郑谷","name":"叙事感恩上狄右丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔岁曾投贽，关河在左冯。\n庾公垂顾遇，王粲许从容。\n首荐叨殊礼，全家寓近封。\n白楼陪写望，青眼感遭逢。\n顾念梁间燕，深怜涧底松。\n岚光莲岳逼，酒味菊花浓。\n寇难旋移国，漂离几听蛩。\n半生悲逆旅，二纪间门墉。\n蜀雪随僧蹋，荆烟逐雁冲。\n凋零归两鬓，举止失前踪。\n得事虽甘晚，陈诗未肯慵。\n迩来趋九仞，又伴赏三峯。\n栖托情何限，吹嘘意数重。\n自兹俦侣内，无复叹龙锺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}